diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index f09d668..cb86b8a 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,6 +1,9 @@
 # Version dev
 
 - options `-meta-fold` and `-meta-quantify-range` to obtain instances that are better suited to E-ACSL instrumentation
+- the `\written` and `\read` instances built from the contract of a callee no longer keep the
+  `Old` and `Pre` labels of that contract, which are not valid (or denote another state) in the
+  assertion generated at the call
 
